            "value": "Pindai Kode Pemasangan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scanning isn't available on this device. Enter the code manually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pemindaian tidak tersedia di perangkat ini. Masukkan kode secara manual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send test location": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kirim lokasi uji"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share location": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bagikan lokasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sharing ended": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Berbagi berakhir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the last reported location of %@ to authorized staff of %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tampilkan lokasi terakhir yang dilaporkan %1$@ kepada staf berwenang %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in to iCloud in Settings with the fleet Apple ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masuk ke iCloud di Pengaturan dengan Apple ID armada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in to iCloud in Settings, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masuk ke iCloud di Pengaturan, lalu coba lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop this tracking agreement": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hentikan perjanjian pelacakan ini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop this tracking agreement?": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hentikan perjanjian pelacakan ini?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That code isn't valid. Check it and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode itu tidak valid. Periksa lalu coba lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rental business ended this pairing. Location sharing has stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bisnis sewa mengakhiri pemasangan ini. Berbagi lokasi telah berhenti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rental business no longer accepts this pairing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bisnis sewa tidak lagi menerima pemasangan ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sharing period for this rental has ended.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masa berbagi untuk sewa ini telah berakhir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code has expired. Ask the rental business for a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode ini sudah kedaluwarsa. Minta kode baru ke bisnis sewa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code was already used. Ask the rental business for a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode ini sudah dipakai. Minta kode baru ke bisnis sewa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is paired to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perangkat ini dipasangkan ke %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tracker Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnostik Tracker"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tracking active": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pelacakan aktif"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpair Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lepas Pemasangan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpair this iPhone?": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lepas pemasangan iPhone ini?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpaired on this iPhone. Couldn't reach the business to confirm; they can also revoke it on their side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pemasangan dilepas di iPhone ini. Tidak dapat menghubungi bisnis untuk konfirmasi; mereka juga bisa mencabutnya dari sisi mereka."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpairing stops Rentro from associating future location updates with this rental unit. Data the business already holds follows its retention policy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Melepas pemasangan menghentikan Rentro mengaitkan pembaruan lokasi berikutnya dengan unit sewa ini. Data yang sudah dimiliki bisnis mengikuti kebijakan retensinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pembaruan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this when the rental device is being removed or reconfigured. Pairing again needs a new code and a new agreement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gunakan ini saat perangkat sewa dilepas atau dikonfigurasi ulang. Memasangkan lagi memerlukan kode baru dan perjanjian baru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the owner to share the fleet with this Apple ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menunggu pemilik membagikan armada ke Apple ID ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting to upload": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menunggu diunggah"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is shared": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yang dibagikan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While using the app": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saat aplikasi dipakai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You paused sharing. Nothing is being sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anda menjeda berbagi. Tidak ada yang dikirim."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline. Try again when you have a connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anda sedang offline. Coba lagi saat tersambung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your control": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kendali Anda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for location permission. You can change it in Settings, or stop sharing in this app, at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS meminta izin lokasi. Anda dapat mengubahnya di Pengaturan, atau berhenti berbagi di aplikasi ini, kapan saja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS may delay or pause location in the background to save battery. Contact the rental business if this iPhone keeps showing no recent signal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS dapat menunda atau menjeda lokasi di latar belakang untuk menghemat baterai. Hubungi bisnis sewa jika iPhone ini terus menunjukkan tidak ada sinyal terbaru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
